---
status: developing
title: multi-step process
---

A pre-defined set of two or more :term[steps] designed to achieve an outcome.

:::note
The process may be presented within a single page, across multiple pages, screens, views, dialogs, or any combination thereof.
:::

:::note
The process may contain optional, conditional, or dynamically generated steps which may or may not include branching logic.
:::

:::note
Branching logic which results in a varying number of steps is considered a multi-step process.
:::

:::note
Examples include checkout, registration, account creation, financial filing, application submission, and booking workflows.
:::
